<title>POLAND: GDANSKI Q1 NET FALLS TO PLN 26.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>GDANSKI Q1 NET FALLS TO PLN 26.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank Gdanski preliminary results</p>
<p>for the first quarter of the year ending March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q1 1997     Q1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit		    42.45    vs  57.84</p>
